# 统一换行符：仓库内一律存 LF，检出时按平台还原。
# 关键点：gradlew 是 shell 脚本，必须是 LF。否则 Linux/macOS 上会报
# "bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M" —— Windows 上很容易被编辑器或 core.autocrlf 改成 CRLF。
* text=auto
gradlew text eol=lf
gradlew.bat text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制：禁止任何换行符转换
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
